{"4222700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Racing Manager", "steam_appid": 4222700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing Manager</strong> is a motorsport management and strategy game where you take control of a racing team as its Team Principal. Build the perfect staff, develop your car, manage your finances, and make the key decisions that will influence every race weekend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze performance data, adjust your drivers’ strategy, monitor tire wear, and choose the ideal moment for pit stops. Every decision matters if you want to stay competitive against rival teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit skilled staff members, improve your technical facilities, optimize your budget, and guide your team to the top.<br>The final version will include multiple championships, a wide selection of drivers and teams, additional circuits, and a complete career mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a fan of management games or passionate about motorsports, <strong>Racing Manager</strong> delivers an accessible, deep, and immersive strategic experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Racing Manager</strong> is a motorsport management and strategy game where you take control of a racing team as its Team Principal. Build the perfect staff, develop your car, manage your finances, and make the key decisions that will influence every race weekend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze performance data, adjust your drivers’ strategy, monitor tire wear, and choose the ideal moment for pit stops. Every decision matters if you want to stay competitive against rival teams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit skilled staff members, improve your technical facilities, optimize your budget, and guide your team to the top.<br>The final version will include multiple championships, a wide selection of drivers and teams, additional circuits, and a complete career mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a fan of management games or passionate about motorsports, <strong>Racing Manager</strong> delivers an accessible, deep, and immersive strategic experience.</p>", "short_description": "Manage your racing team: strategy, tires, staff, budget, and real-time decisions. Build the perfect crew and lead them to victory in this immersive motorsport management game.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222700/7ac314871896b45e44308556216f120ab5185ca3/header.jpg?t=1788076629", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222700/e1400ca44f505453e8931ee14c74a8c96f1fb4c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788076629", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222700/e1400ca44f505453e8931ee14c74a8c96f1fb4c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788076629", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.9 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Underdog Factory"], "publishers": ["Underdog Factory"], "demos": [{"appid": 4231260, "description": ""}], "package_g